%% title: What happens when the connection or sign-in breaks
%% desc: No internet shows a bar with Try again. Slow internet shows a bar to wait. An ended session opens a Sign in again window, your typed text stays, and you press Save again.
flowchart LR
  A["No internet<br/>bar"] --> B["Press<br/>Try again"]
  C["Slow internet<br/>bar"] --> D["Wait"]
  E["Sign in again<br/>window"] --> F["Sign in"] --> G["Press Save<br/>again"]:::done
  classDef done fill:#ebfbee,stroke:#2b8a3e,color:#14411d
